d_animation" style="animation-delay: 0.78s">cannot</span> <span class="word_animation" style="animation-delay: 0.41s">go</span> <span class="word_animation" style="animation-delay: 0.96s">against</span> <span class="word_animation" style="animation-delay: 0.62s">nature,</span> <span class="word_animation" style="animation-delay: 0.28s">only</span> <span class="word_animation" style="animation-delay: 0.73s">design</span> <span class="word_animation" style="animation-delay: 0.38s">and</span> <span class="word_animation" style="animation-delay: 0.86s">make</span> <span class="word_animation" style="animation-delay: 0.54s">choices</span> <span class="word_animation" style="animation-delay: 0.10s">around</span> <span class="word_animation" style="animation-delay: 0.69s">it.</span>
<br><br>
<span class="word_animation" style="animation-delay: 0.34s">"Revery"</span> <span class="word_animation" style="animation-delay: 0.93s">means</span> <span class="word_animation" style="animation-delay: 0.57s">"daydreamer"</span> <span class="word_animation" style="animation-delay: 0.20s">("dagdrömmare"</span> <span class="word_animation" style="animation-delay: 0.77s">in</span> <span class="word_animation" style="animation-delay: 0.45s">Swedish),</span> <span class="word_animation" style="animation-delay: 0.06s">a</span> <span class="word_animation" style="animation-delay: 0.83s">recurrent</span> <span class="word_animation" style="animation-delay: 0.49s">name</span> <span class="word_animation" style="animation-delay: 0.16s">recalled</span> <span class="word_animation" style="animation-delay: 0.71s">by</span> <span class="word_animation" style="animation-delay: 0.30s">teachers</span> <span class="word_animation" style="animation-delay: 0.98s">in</span> <span class="word_animation" style="animation-delay: 0.64s">his</span> <span class="word_animation" style="animation-delay: 0.26s">youth.</span> <span class="word_animation" style="animation-delay: 0.80s">When</span> <span class="word_animation" style="animation-delay: 0.43s">it</span> <span class="word_animation" style="animation-delay: 0.08s">came</span> <span class="word_animation" style="animation-delay: 0.75s">to</span> <span class="word_animation" style="animation-delay: 0.40s">pick</span> <span class="word_animation" style="animation-delay: 0.95s">something</span> <span class="word_animation" style="animation-delay: 0.60s">to</span> <span class="word_animation" style="animation-delay: 0.24s">release</span> <span class="word_animation" style="animation-delay: 0.87s">music</span> <span class="word_animation" style="animation-delay: 0.52s">with,</span> <span class="word_animation" style="animation-delay: 0.13s">it</span> <span class="word_animation" style="animation-delay: 0.65s">felt</span> <span class="word_animation" style="animation-delay: 0.32s">like</span> <span class="word_animation" style="animation-delay: 0.90s">a</span> <span class="word_animation" style="animation-delay: 0.56s">natural</span> <span class="word_animation" style="animation-delay: 0.22s">fit</span> <span class="word_animation" style="animation-delay: 0.81s">for</span> <span class="word_animation" style="animation-delay: 0.47s">the</span> <span class="word_animation" style="animation-delay: 0.11s">atmospheric</span> <span class="word_animation" style="animation-delay: 0.74s">nature</span> <span class="word_animation" style="animation-delay: 0.38s">of</span> <span class="word_animation" style="animation-delay: 0.01s">his</span> <span class="word_animation" style="animation-delay: 0.67s">genre</span> <span class="word_animation" style="animation-delay: 0.35s">of</span> <span class="word_animation" style="animation-delay: 0.92s">music.</span>
