<!-- FAQ Section -->
<section class="py-28">
    <div class="page-container max-w-4xl mx-auto extra_fade_effect">
        <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl mb-8 text-center text-zinc-900 dark:text-white">
            Frequently Asked Questions
        </h2>
        
        <div class="space-y-2">
            <!-- FAQ Item 1 -->
            <div class="faq-item border border-zinc-200 dark:border-white/10 rounded-lg overflow-hidden">
                <input type="checkbox" id="faq-1" class="faq-toggle hidden">
                <label for="faq-1" class="faq-question block p-4 cursor-pointer hover:bg-zinc-50 dark:hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-zinc-900 dark:text-white pr-8">
                            What is the best way to support your music (besides streaming)?
                        </h3>
                        <span class="faq-icon text-3xl text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400 flex-shrink-0">+</span>
                    </div>
                </label>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    <div class="p-4 text-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-200">
                        <p>Honestly, just telling someone about my music; share it!</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- FAQ Item 2 -->
            <div class="faq-item border border-zinc-200 dark:border-white/10 rounded-lg overflow-hidden">
                <input type="checkbox" id="faq-2" class="faq-toggle hidden">
                <label for="faq-2" class="faq-question block p-4 cursor-pointer hover:bg-zinc-50 dark:hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-zinc-900 dark:text-white pr-8">
                            Are all the graphics and artworks your own?
                        </h3>
                        <span class="faq-icon text-3xl text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400 flex-shrink-0">+</span>
                    </div>
                </label>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    <div class="p-4 text-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-200">
                        <p>Yes! I think that the visual graphics for a track reflects the effort of the song itself. I made the song hence I should do the cover art, it’s truly my art. I even made a font (the one you see on this website) to match the logo that I use for everything related to this project.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- FAQ Item 3 -->
            <div class="faq-item border border-zinc-200 dark:border-white/10 rounded-lg overflow-hidden">
                <input type="checkbox" id="faq-3" class="faq-toggle hidden">
                <label for="faq-3" class="faq-question block p-4 cursor-pointer hover:bg-zinc-50 dark:hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-zinc-900 dark:text-white pr-8">
                           Are you available for live performances/DJ?
                        </h3>
                        <span class="faq-icon text-3xl text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400 flex-shrink-0">+</span>
                    </div>
                </label>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    <div class="p-4 text-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-200">
                        <p>If I have time and can travel to said location, then yes!</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- FAQ Item 4 -->
            <div class="faq-item border border-zinc-200 dark:border-white/10 rounded-lg overflow-hidden">
                <input type="checkbox" id="faq-4" class="faq-toggle hidden">
                <label for="faq-4" class="faq-question block p-4 cursor-pointer hover:bg-zinc-50 dark:hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-zinc-900 dark:text-white pr-8">
                            Who should I contact for interview requests, features and booking?
                        </h3>
                        <span class="faq-icon text-3xl text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400 flex-shrink-0">+</span>
                    </div>
                </label>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    <div class="p-4 text-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-200">
                        <p>The contact page has the information about that.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- FAQ Item 5 -->
            <div class="faq-item border border-zinc-200 dark:border-white/10 rounded-lg overflow-hidden">
                <input type="checkbox" id="faq-5" class="faq-toggle hidden">
                <label for="faq-5" class="faq-question block p-4 cursor-pointer hover:bg-zinc-50 dark:hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-zinc-900 dark:text-white pr-8">
                            What hardware and software do you use?
                        </h3>
                        <span class="faq-icon text-3xl text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400 flex-shrink-0">+</span>
                    </div>
                </label>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    <div class="p-4 text-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-200">
                        <p>Hardware: Main setup is Yamaha HS7 with Native Instruments Komplete Audio 6 and a Hitachi AX-M76E system for reference listening. I have a Focusrite Scarlett 2i2 for another set of HS7 when not in my studio at home. For field-recordings I use Zoom H8. <br><br> 
                
                Software: FL Studio is my main DAW (unfortunately). For synths I use Harmor (built into FL Studio), Native Instruments Rounds, Xfer Serum, Surge, Odin 2 and Arminator2 (got a softspot for jankware). For making kicks I use Sonic Academy Kick 2, but I also use Geonkick. My go to equalizer is ReaPlugs ReaEQ, since I just want good performance and no delays with routing automation, it just works. For LFO volume stuff I use Gross Beat or TiagoLr GATE-12. For reverb I use ValhallaSupermassive if I want to save CPU or Native Instruments Raum if I want to be fancy. For delay effects I just use the Fruity Delay 3.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>


              <!-- FAQ Item 6 -->
              <div class="faq-item border border-zinc-200 dark:border-white/10 rounded-lg overflow-hidden">
                  <input type="checkbox" id="faq-6" class="faq-toggle hidden">
                  <label for="faq-6" class="faq-question block p-4 cursor-pointer hover:bg-zinc-50 dark:hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors">
                      <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                          <h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-zinc-900 dark:text-white pr-8">
                              Are you currently signed to a label or independent?
                          </h3>
                          <span class="faq-icon text-3xl text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400 flex-shrink-0">+</span>
                      </div>
                  </label>
                  <div class="faq-answer">
                      <div class="p-4 text-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-200">
                          <p>Not signed to anything, 100% independent.</p>
                      </div>
                  </div>
              </div>

              <!-- FAQ Item 7 -->
              <div class="faq-item border border-zinc-200 dark:border-white/10 rounded-lg overflow-hidden">
                  <input type="checkbox" id="faq-7" class="faq-toggle hidden">
                  <label for="faq-7" class="faq-question block p-4 cursor-pointer hover:bg-zinc-50 dark:hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors">
                      <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                          <h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-zinc-900 dark:text-white pr-8">
                              Educational background? Perhaps something related to music?
                          </h3>
                          <span class="faq-icon text-3xl text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400 flex-shrink-0">+</span>
                      </div>
                  </label>
                  <div class="faq-answer">
                      <div class="p-4 text-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-200">
                          <p>My parents pushed me to play the guitar, but I never put any effort into it, then I switched over to the piano instead thinking it would be better; nope! I lost interest fast and my parent’s money was wasted there too. That’s my only “musical background“ I guess. Ironically when I was 15 and I stopped taking piano lessons that’s when I started learning music production on my own. My educational background is physics, I hold bachelor's degree in engineering physics.</p> 
          
                      </div>
                  </div>
              </div>

              <!-- FAQ Item 8 -->
              <div class="faq-item border border-zinc-200 dark:border-white/10 rounded-lg overflow-hidden">
                  <input type="checkbox" id="faq-8" class="faq-toggle hidden">
                  <label for="faq-8" class="faq-question block p-4 cursor-pointer hover:bg-zinc-50 dark:hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors">
                      <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                          <h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-zinc-900 dark:text-white pr-8">
                              Are your songs available for sync licensing (film, live stream, internet content, TV, ads)?
                          </h3>
                          <span class="faq-icon text-3xl text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400 flex-shrink-0">+</span>
                      </div>
                  </label>
                  <div class="faq-answer">
                      <div class="p-4 text-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-200">
                          <p>For live streaming my music; a quick mention of the track is appreciated. For internet content (such as content in TikTok, Youtube, Facebook formats) I’m fine with just you providing a link in the description/post (of said content) to my social media profiles (instagram and/or soundloud) if you use one of my songs. If it’s for film or TV; contact me about it.</p>
         
                      </div>
                  </div>
              </div>




        </div>
    </div>
</section>






















